2025-05-20 10:19:08,023 - INFO - The significant growth of the independent consultancy industry is due to the affordability and flexibility offered by independent consultants. For example, in the UK, Independent consulting firms account for 10% of the USD 13 billion consulting sector. As a result, the traditional consulting firms. Thus, the emergence of the independent consultant is expected to create lucrative opportunities for the market during the forecast period.
